  Debug-only network policy for the ping_journey integration-test host.

  The hermetic integration-test mode starts an in-process HttpServer inside the test process and
  points the SDK at it over plain HTTP. Android blocks cleartext traffic by default (API 28+), so
  loopback — and only loopback — is opted back in here. Everything else keeps the platform default,
  which is HTTPS-only, so pointing the tests at a real tenant still requires TLS.

  This file lives in src/debug/ and is therefore never merged into a release build.
-->
<network-security-config>
    <domain-config cleartextTrafficPermitted="true">
        <domain includeSubdomains="false">127.0.0.1</domain>
        <domain includeSubdomains="false">localhost</domain>
    </domain-config>
</network-security-config>
